	(text "Pressure sensors can be wired in 2 or 3 wire mode.\n3 wire mode outputs voltage propotional to pressure, randing from 0-Vdc.\n2 wire mode outputs 4-20mA current linear with pressure.\nConnect 3v3 to pressure sensor Vcc for voltage output.\nConnect 24V to pressure sensor Vcc for current output.\nConnect GND to pressure sensor only for 3 wire voltage output mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 64.77 36.83 0)
